Your nose tingles as you smell spoilers...



Ok so my steroid taking Barbarian with all the best armor in the game,
every spell, blessed rustproof Mojollnir, Vorpal Blade, and Stormbringer +6,
all tools, etc. is running around in Ghennom happily slaying everything in
sight when he decides it would be fun to eat a blessed tin of chamelon meat
to poly into the grey dragon.  So I do, and I kill a few things when along
comes a cockatrice.  I think to myself, no problem they have sucky HP one
round of attacks and its history.  So I close for the kill and I get this...

You bite the cockatrice.
You turn to stone.
You die...

Nasty...seems anything with a bite attack can't face the lowly cockatrice
without dying. Fortunatly I had one of my 8 amulets of life saving on, but I
had no others with me, so it was quite a comical sight to see this huge grey
dragon fleeing like a spineless wimp from a cockatrice.  I blasted the damn
thing with missiles, but it didn't die, so I fled upstairs and killed the poly
form and killed the bugger with a nice,safe weapon. :)

- Chris M.

